QBase is a source-available database diagram editor with an optional
self-hosted backend, developed in-house by Qubdi.

Acknowledgement
---------------
QBase is inspired by ChartDB (https://github.com/chartdb/chartdb), an open
source database diagram editor under the AGPL-3.0 licence. The QBase editor was
written anew from a description of how such an editor behaves; it does not
contain ChartDB's source code, apart from a few generic boilerplate files that
come from the same upstream (see rewrite/similarity-allow.txt). Thank you to the
